    "updated_at": "2019-10-16T11:34:44Z",
    "body": "Yeah, apologies for making it that concrete, it's probably more some kind of function that takes various things into account and returns a boolean. (Even if the keyboard is used it might still not make sense to show an outline around an element so it cannot really be a global decision. E.g., for a video element the user agent might want to highlight individual controls, but not the entire element.)",
